# Note Taker App - Project Overview

This is a React Native note-taking app built with Expo to learn mobile development.

## Tech Stack

- **Framework**: React Native with Expo Router (file-based routing)
- **Styling**: NativeWind (Tailwind CSS)
- **State Management**: Zustand (for global UI state only)
- **Data Fetching**: TanStack Query (React Query) for all server state
- **Backend**: Firebase (Auth, Firestore, Storage)
- **Forms**: React Hook Form + Zod validation
- **UI Components**: React Native Reusables
- **Performance**: FlashList (high-performance lists)
- **Animations**: React Native Reanimated (smooth, performant animations)
- **UI Libraries**: @gorhom/bottom-sheet (bottom sheets)
- **Storage**: react-native-mmkv (fast key-value storage)
- **i18n**: Lingui (internationalization, if needed)
- **Language**: TypeScript (strict mode)

## Project Structure

```text
/app              - Expo Router pages (file-based routing)
/components       - Reusable UI components
/lib              - Utilities, configs, validation schemas
/services         - Firebase operations and API layer
/store            - Zustand stores for global state
/hooks            - Custom React hooks
/constants        - App constants and theme configs
```

## Architecture Principles

- Use Expo Router file-based routing for navigation
- Use TanStack Query for ALL data fetching (Firebase operations)
- Use Zustand ONLY for global UI state (not server state)
- Follow React Native best practices and patterns
- Use TypeScript strictly with proper types (avoid `any`)
- Implement proper error handling and loading states
- Use component composition patterns
- Style with NativeWind (Tailwind CSS classes)
- Use React Hook Form + Zod for all form validation
- Use React Native Reanimated for all animations (prefer over Animated API)

## Current State

- Firebase is configured but auth services are commented out (need activation)
- Basic auth screens exist (sign-in, sign-up, forgot-password)
- TanStack Query client is set up in `lib/queryClient.ts`
- Zustand store structure exists but needs implementation
- NativeWind is configured and working

## Learning Focus

This is a learning project. Focus on:

- Understanding React Native fundamentals
- Learning Expo Router navigation patterns
- Mastering TanStack Query for data fetching
- Understanding Firebase integration
- Building mobile-first UI/UX
- Creating smooth animations with React Native Reanimated
